lead.memo.output:
{
  "choice": "within",
  "known_facts": {
    "text": "On May 24, 2023, NVIDIA guided to Q2 FY2024 total revenue of USD 11.00 billion, plus or minus 2%. Management said it was increasing supply to meet surging demand.",
    "citations": [
      {"passage_id": "P1", "quote": "Revenue is expected to be $11.00 billion, plus or minus 2%."},
      {"passage_id": "P2", "quote": "We are significantly increasing our supply to meet surging demand for them"}
    ]
  },
  "base_case": {
    "text": "As of May 25, my base case is that Q2 FY2024 total revenue finishes within guidance. The new outlook likely already accounts for strong AI demand and the planned supply ramp; strong demand alone is not a reason to expect a beat.",
    "citations": [
      {"passage_id": "P4", "quote": "led by growing demand for generative AI and large language models using GPUs based on our NVIDIA Hopper and Ampere architectures."},
      {"passage_id": "P2", "quote": "We are significantly increasing our supply to meet surging demand for them"}
    ]
  },
  "alternative": {
    "text": "Above guidance is plausible if NVIDIA ships more Hopper GPUs than planned and books the extra sales in Q2. Management reported that H100 was in production, but did not establish when shipments would reach customers.",
    "citations": [
      {"passage_id": "P2", "quote": "Our entire data center family of products — H100, Grace CPU, Grace Hopper Superchip, NVLink, Quantum 400 InfiniBand and BlueField-3 DPU — is in production."},
      {"passage_id": "P4", "quote": "The revenue growth reflects strong demand from large consumer internet companies and cloud service providers."}
    ]
  },
  "revision_signal": {
    "text": "Before earnings, I would tilt toward above guidance if major cloud providers confirm broad availability of H100 instances earlier than expected. Broad access, rather than a limited preview, would suggest faster shipments, though it would not prove that NVIDIA booked the sales in Q2.",
    "citations": [
      {"passage_id": "P4", "quote": "The revenue growth reflects strong demand from large consumer internet companies and cloud service providers."},
      {"passage_id": "P2", "quote": "We are significantly increasing our supply to meet surging demand for them"}
    ]
  }
}

